      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChess by Nex1942 in the revamped VRChat Home world would bring a lot of attention to a world that deserves it. The nice thing about the chess world is that it's a very well done game that's virtually grief proof with boards that players sign into. It's a good place for people of all ages and skill levels to come together and participate in a virtual activity that is normally only done in person or against a faceless person online. It really resembles a real life chess club. Tons of people in the community are willing to teach and be taught. It's one of the best ways to make friends and experience what VRChat is all about and what it is intended to be.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
